<h1 style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;">Billing & Plans</h1>
<p>UTMPro offers flexible plans for teams of all sizes.</p>
<h2>Plans</h2>
<table><tr><th>Plan</th><th>Price</th><th>Links/mo</th><th>Events/mo</th><th>Key Features</th></tr>
<tr><td>Free</td><td>$0</td><td>25</td><td>1,000</td><td>Basic analytics, 1 domain</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pro</td><td>$30/mo</td><td>1,000</td><td>50,000</td><td>Password protection, API, 3 domains</td></tr>
<tr><td>Business</td><td>$90/mo</td><td>10,000</td><td>250,000</td><td>A/B testing, partner program, webhooks</td></tr>
<tr><td>Advanced</td><td>$300/mo</td><td>50,000</td><td>1,000,000</td><td>Everything + priority support</td></tr>
</table></div>
<h2>Upgrading</h2>
<p>Go to <strong>Settings → Billing → Change Plan</strong>. You'll be redirected to Stripe Checkout to enter payment details. Your plan upgrades immediately after payment.</p>
<h2>Managing Subscription</h2>
<p>Click <strong>Manage Billing</strong> to open the Stripe Customer Portal where you can update payment methods, view invoices, or cancel your subscription.</p>
<h2>Invoices</h2>
<p>All invoices are listed on the Billing page with PDF download links.</p>
